{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22882","headline":"石榴树 · 白居易","name":"石榴树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜颜色好阴凉，叶翦红牋花扑霜。\n繖盖低垂金翡翠，熏笼乱搭绣衣裳。\n春芽细炷千灯焰，夏蘂浓焚百[和]香。\n见说上林无此树，只教桃柳占年芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}